{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "John Meets Sandra", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Hook, Line, and Sinker", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "high seas", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the part of a sea that's far away from land", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The cruise ship is sailing on the high seas. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to describe someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describing People", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you describe people, you use adjectives to describe their physical appearance and personality.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the structure <span class=\"italic\">She's</span> or <span class=\"italic\">He's got ...</span> to talk about a person's physical appearance.<br/><br/>You use the structure <span class=\"italic\">She is</span> or <span class=\"italic\">He is ...</span> to talk about a person's personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example Adjectives on Physical Appearance\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example Adjectives on Personality\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tall \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"friendly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"slender\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"smart\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gorgeous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"warm-hearted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"toned\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"understanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"elegant\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"passionate\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "She's got a tall and slender figure, and she's so friendly and warm-hearted.<br/> <br/> <br/>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " The Past Tense & The Past Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use a verb in the Simple Past tense with a verb in the Past Continuous tense when you talk about what you were doing when something else happened.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "She was having lunch when I called her. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She called back while I was working.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sinker", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an unsuccessful question or suggestion", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: John's line to ask Sandra to go out was a real sinker.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "warm-hearted", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes someone who is very kind", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sandra is a very friendly and warm-hearted person. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "toned", "type": "name"}, {"content": "muscles that are firm", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sandra has a toned body because she exercises a lot.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to sway", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move slowly from side to side", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sandra's hair sways elegantly when she walks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to gain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to learn something new; to get experience", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter really gained some knowledge to help with his job at the workshop.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to ask someone to go out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask someone to go out on a date", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Michael asked Alysha to go out to a movie.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "understanding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes someone who shows sympathy or that they understand a problem well", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sandra was very understanding when John was nervous.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "passionate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes someone who feels strongly about something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sandra is passionate about good coffee.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Using adjectives for appearance and personality, describe a colleague at work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write sentences on what else was happening when you did something or what someone else was doing when you did something. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use a Past tense verb and a Past Continuous verb in the same sentence. <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I describe someone's appearance and personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write sentences to talk about what was happening or what someone else was doing when I did something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express completed events in the past and the continual events in the past in the same statement.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le07ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hi, John. How's life on the high seas?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Getting better, Peter. I gained some insight from that workshop on customer service, like greeting every customer and starting a loyalty program on the ship.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Excellent! How is Sandra?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Oh, she's intelligent and funny with a sweet smile. I asked her to go out for a coffee."}, {"image": "engenn5le07ob06re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Nice going.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: My line was a real sinker, but she's so warm-hearted and understanding that she accepted. She called back while I was working. And she's really passionate about good coffee.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: When I got the last message from you, you were describing how lovely she is."}, {"image": "engenn5le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "36000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yeah, she has a gorgeous figure that's really toned. She probably goes to the gym. When we walked together on the deck, her long hair was swaying elegantly in the breeze.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Are you in love?"}], "coverimg": "engenn5le07ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can describe people's appearance and personality. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can say what I was doing when something else happened.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Did you ever meet someone interesting at your workplace? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What's he or she like?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " John meets someone he likes.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " John is <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">in love</span> with someone at work. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "You can say you're feeling <span class=\"italic\">\u201cin love\u201d</span> even though the relationship is new and not at that level yet.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "type": "STI", "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}]}, {"id": 2, "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Describe a colleague at work. Write sentences on what else happened when you were doing something at work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"conten